# Quag Feast: "Mill two cards, then destroy the chosen permanent if its mana value is less than or equal to the number of cards in
# your graveyard." Bot2 has a Bonecrusher Giant (mana value 3). The first Quag Feast on turn 3 mills two cards: two cards in the
# graveyard (the spell itself, still on the stack, does not count) are fewer than three, so the Giant lives. On turn 5 the
# graveyard holds three cards (the two Swamps and the first Feast) before the second Feast mills two more: five is at least
# three and the Giant is destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Quag Feast
Quag Feast
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x4
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Bonecrusher Giant
Mountain x16

